    <item>
      <title>#24 双面镜城与午夜欢宴</title>
      <link>https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter24</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter24</guid>
      <description>清晨七点，手机刺耳的铃声划破了房间内粘稠的沉寂。不是闹钟，是特定联系人的专属铃声。</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 06:20:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>#25 银幕下的暗潮与隔间内的盛宴</title>
      <link>https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter25</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter25</guid>
      <description>清晨的阳光，透过依旧厚重的窗帘缝隙，切割出一道锐利的金色光柱，落在凌乱的床单上，照亮了空气中飞舞的微尘，也照亮了悠真大腿根部那片已经近乎全黑、再也分辨不出单个字迹的皮肤。那片皮肤微微红肿，墨迹边缘有些晕染，像是某种古老而邪异的纹身，深深烙印进皮肉深处。</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 06:20:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>#26 潜意识烙印与疼痛圣礼</title>
      <link>https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter26</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter26</guid>
      <description>晨光，再一次，以一种近乎机械的精准，切割开房间内的昏暗。但今日的光线似乎与往日不同，它不再仅仅是照亮尘嚣与情欲痕迹的旁观者，而是被赋予了某种任务——透过特意调整角度的百叶窗，在房间中央的地毯上，投下一道道明暗相间的、如同牢笼栅栏般的光影。</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 06:20:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>#27 贱犬的渴宴</title>
      <link>https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter27</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter27</guid>
      <description>晨光，第一次，显得如此多余。</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 06:20:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>#28 夜啼与晨礼</title>
      <link>https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter28</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://naiii.novel.fucktx.eu.org/articles/tsandsis/chapter28</guid>
      <description>夜色浓稠如墨，时针悄然滑过凌晨两点的刻度。万籁俱寂，连城市永不疲倦的呼吸似乎也在此刻变得轻柔。铃音的房间内，只有角落一盏盐灯散发着恒定不变的、微弱的橙红色光晕，勉强勾勒出家具模糊的轮廓和床上那微微隆起的一团。</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 06:20:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
